{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"四年春，宋公使華元來聘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"三月壬申，鄭伯堅卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"杞伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"夏四月甲寅，臧孫許卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"公如晉。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"葬鄭襄公。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"秋，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"冬，城鄆。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"鄭伯伐許。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"四年，春，宋華元來聘，通嗣君也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"杞伯來朝，歸叔姬故也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"夏，公如晉。晉侯見公，不敬。季文子曰：「晉侯必不免。《詩》曰：『敬之敬之！天惟顯思，命不易哉！』夫晉侯之命，在諸侯矣，可不敬乎？」","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"秋，公至自晉，欲求成于楚而叛晉。季文子曰：「不可。晉雖無道，未可叛也。國大、臣睦，而邇於我，諸侯聽焉，未可以貳。史佚之志有之，曰：『非我族類，其心必異。』楚雖大，非吾族也，其肯字我乎？」公乃止。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"冬，十一月，鄭公孫申帥師疆許田。許人敗諸展陂。鄭伯伐許，取鉏任、泠敦之田。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"晉欒書將中軍，荀首佐之，士燮佐上軍，以救許伐鄭，取泛、祭。楚子反救鄭，鄭伯與許男訟焉，皇戌攝鄭伯之辭。子反不能決也，曰：「君若辱在寡君，寡君與其二三臣，共聽兩君之所欲，成其可知也。不然，側不足以知二國之成。」","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_136_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_136","textTraditional":"晉趙嬰通于趙莊姬。","sentenceOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}